                        "review": "dev be like:how bout we take all your skills and items in semi-final battle? \nhow bout you never develop a game again dipshit.\n\n\nOh actualy the whole final is fucking 4thh wall breaking and battles that have little to no connection to meech battles or plot in general. Cool game that slowly transform in to slow repetative torture and garbage plot that parodises and sodomises itself for no coherent reason. \n\nModern day arthouse of a videogame-tons of cool ideas, horribly attached to each other in a way they can no longer work. Its a game that will hook you with first 2 awesome hours, only to waster your time and completely disrespect itself and you in next 20 to the point that all good faith it builds completely transform in to boredom,disgust and constant rage due to wasting your time.\n\nAvoid like a plague.\n\nPs\n20-40% of all playtimes in all reviews is just running around through one empty screen to another that may, potentialy have something. I wish i was joking or exagerating.",
